ont style='font-size:10px'&gt;Realisasi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{inherit: evidence}&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="780" width="230" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-rea-a" value="&lt;i&gt;(rincian: DCD 2–4)&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd1-rea"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="230" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-g-rea-evi" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#6C4A87;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tk-dcd1-rea" target="tk-dcd1-evi"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-tin" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.tinjauan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Tinjauan Rencana&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{inherit: evidence}&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="890" width="230" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-tin-a" value="&lt;i&gt;(rincian: DCD 2–4)&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd1-tin"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="230" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-g-tin-evi" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#6C4A87;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tk-dcd1-tin" target="tk-dcd1-evi"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n0" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, §13.6; UML)&lt;br&gt;• Ungu «AbstractModel» (nama miring) = &lt;i&gt;mixin&lt;/i&gt; tanpa tabel; segitiga kosong ungu = &lt;code&gt;_inherit = [mixin, …]&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• «Odoo» abu-abu = model bawaan; bila diberi &lt;code&gt;{_inherit: …}&lt;/code&gt;, model itu diperluas tanpa &lt;code&gt;_name&lt;/code&gt; baru. «Core» abu-abu putus-putus = master bersama di labfik_core. Tepi merah = model hasil desain yang tidak ada padanannya 1:1 di CM.&lt;br&gt;• Panah terbuka = Many2one/Many2many berarah, label = nama field. Belah ketupat hitam = One2many + Many2one (anak ikut terhapus). Putus-putus = field &lt;code&gt;compute&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Atribut bertipe hanya untuk model bawaan Odoo (hr.employee, res.users, res.currency, ir.attachment). Field warisan mixin tidak ditulis ulang.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;+&lt;/code&gt; publik (&lt;code&gt;action_*&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;get_*&lt;/code&gt;), &lt;code&gt;#&lt;/code&gt; internal (&lt;code&gt;_…&lt;/code&gt;), @model, «override», {abstract}, {hook}." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1020" width="760" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Template Method&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;action_sahkan(pengesah, tanggal_sah)&lt;/code&gt; — urutan tetap di mixin, tidak di-&lt;i&gt;override&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;br&gt;1. state harus &lt;i&gt;diajukan&lt;/i&gt; · 2. berkas_ttd ada (AB-04) · 3. &lt;code&gt;_cek_wewenang(pengesah)&lt;/code&gt; (AB-05) · 4. &lt;code&gt;_sebelum_disahkan()&lt;/code&gt; {hook} · 5. tulis pengesah, pencatat = pengguna, tanggal_sah, state = disahkan · 6. &lt;code&gt;_dokumen_diganti()&lt;/code&gt; {hook} → state = diganti + log (AB-08) · 7. log &lt;i&gt;disahkan&lt;/i&gt; (AB-09) · 8. &lt;code&gt;_setelah_disahkan()&lt;/code&gt; {hook}.&lt;br&gt;Model turunan hanya mengisi &lt;i&gt;hook&lt;/i&gt;. Hanya grup KaLab yang boleh memanggilnya (AB-06). &lt;code&gt;action_ajukan()&lt;/code&gt; berpola sama: cek draf → &lt;code&gt;_cek_kelengkapan()&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;_sebelum_ajukan()&lt;/code&gt; → ubah status." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="1020" width="640" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Dari CM ke desain&lt;/b&gt; (§13.6)&lt;br&gt;• DokumenDisahkan → &lt;code&gt;approval.mixin&lt;/code&gt;; Pengesahan (0..1) → field readonly di mixin; KejadianPengesahan → &lt;code&gt;approval.log&lt;/code&gt; generik (res_model, res_id) untuk semua dokumen.&lt;br&gt;• RekamanBukti → &lt;code&gt;evidence.mixin&lt;/code&gt;. Periode → &lt;code&gt;period.mixin&lt;/code&gt;. /kriteria_tertinggi → &lt;code&gt;criteria.mixin&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;revisi_dari_id&lt;/code&gt; ditulis di tiap model (Many2one ke model itu sendiri) karena mixin tidak bisa merujuk dirinya.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;labfik.controlled.mixin&lt;/code&gt; tidak dipakai (lihat dokumen)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1480" y="1020" width="480" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n3" value="Design class diagram (masuk proposal Bab II 2.3). Diturunkan dari conceptual model CM-1–4, katalog operasi SSD, dan AB-01–25. Rincian: design-class-tata-kelola.md · Draf 14 Nov 2026 · Febriyan" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1190" width="1420" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="tk-dcd2" name="DCD TO-BE (2-4) - Struktur Organisasi"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1560" pageHeight="934" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-title" value="DCD 2/4 · Struktur organisasi (PKG-03)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1700" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-emp" value="«Odoo»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;hr.employee&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Personel [M]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{_inherit: hr.employee} di labfik_core&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=70;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="300" height="169" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-emp-a" value="+ jenis_personel: Selection {dosen, laboran_plp,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;teknisi, asisten, petugas_k3}&lt;br&gt;+ unit: Selection&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;bawaan dipakai: name, job_id, user_id&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-emp"><mxGeometry x="0" y="70" width="300" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-emp-s" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=inherit;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-emp"><mxGeometry x="0" y="138" width="300" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-emp-m" value="+ unlink() «override» (AB-23)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-emp"><mxGeometry x="0" y="146" width="300" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asl" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.assignment.line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Baris Penetapan [T]&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="275" width="300" height="93" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asl-a" value="+ employee_id: hr.employee&lt;br&gt;+ tanggal_mulai: Date&lt;br&gt;+ tanggal_selesai: Date" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-asl"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="300" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-rng" value="«Core»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;labfik.ruang&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Ruang Lab [M]&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="414" width="220" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-rng-a" value="+ kode: Char&lt;br&gt;+ name: Char&lt;br&gt;+ kapasitas: Integer" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-rng"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="220" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-job" value="«Odoo»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;hr.job&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Jabatan [M]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{_inherit: hr.job} di labfik_core&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=70;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="60" width="340" height="229" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-job-a" value="+ unit: Selection {lab_fik, prodi_if, prodi_si, fakultas}&lt;br&gt;+ is_eksternal: Boolean&lt;br&gt;+ syarat_kompetensi: Text [0..1]&lt;br&gt;+ is_lengkap: Boolean {compute}" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-job"><mxGeometry x="0" y="70" width="340" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-job-s" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=inherit;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-job"><mxGeometry x="0" y="138" width="340" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-job-m" value="+ punya_wewenang(tindakan, jenis): bool&lt;br&gt;@model + cari_pemegang_berwenang(tindakan, jenis): hr.employee&lt;br&gt;# _compute_is_lengkap()&lt;br&gt;# _cek_atasan() @constrains (tanpa siklus)&lt;br&gt;+ unlink() «override» (AB-23)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-job"><mxGeometry x="0" y="146" width="340" height="83" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-tgs" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.jabatan.tugas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Tugas Jabatan [M]&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="335" width="260" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-tgs-a" value="+ urutan: Integer&lt;br&gt;+ uraian: Text" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-tgs"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="260" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-wwn" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.jabatan.wewenang&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Wewenang Jabatan [M]&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="459" width="340" height="93" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-wwn-a" value="+ tindakan: Selection {menyusun, mengesahkan}&lt;br&gt;+ jenis_dokumen: Selection&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;_sql_constraints: unique(jabatan_id, tindakan, jenis_dokumen)&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-wwn"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="340" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asg" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.assignment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;SK Penetapan Pengelola [T]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{inherit: approval, period, criteria}&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="60" width="320" height="199" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asg-a" value="+ nomor_sk: Char «unique»&lt;br&gt;+ judul: Char&lt;br&gt;+ menimbang: Html&lt;br&gt;+ mengingat: Html" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-asg"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="320" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asg-s" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=inherit;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-asg"><mxGeometry x="0" y="123" width="320" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asg-m" value="# _jenis_dokumen() «override»&lt;br&gt;# _cek_kelengkapan() «override»&lt;br&gt;# _dokumen_diganti() «override»&lt;br&gt;# _cek_k1() … _cek_k4() «override»" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-asg"><mxGeometry x="0" y="131" width="320" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-mee" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.meeting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Rapat Koordinasi [T]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{inherit: evidence}&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="305" width="320" height="123" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-mee-a" value="+ agenda: Text&lt;br&gt;+ keputusan: Text&lt;br&gt;+ notulen: Binary&lt;br&gt;+ peserta_ids: hr.employee [*]" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-mee"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="320" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-oev" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.org.evaluation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Evaluasi Struktur [T]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{inherit: evidence}&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="474" width="320" height="154" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-oev-a" value="+ temuan_beban_kerja: Text&lt;br&gt;+ efektivitas_koordinasi: Text&lt;br&gt;+ keputusan: Text&lt;br&gt;+ struktur_diubah: Boolean" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-oev"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="320" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-oev-s" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=inherit;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-oev"><mxGeometry x="0" y="123" width="320" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-oev-m" value="+ action_tautkan_revisi(sk, jabatan)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" pare